**1️⃣ What the data tells us**

| Strategy (chronology) | Avg. reward (10 trials) | Typical episode length* |
|-----------------------|------------------------|--------------------------|
| “big‑velocity → left/right” (|ω₂| > 20) | **‑96.6** | 500 steps (‑500) in many runs |
