| **Lower “fast” threshold (10 rad/s)** | The controller now reacts to moderate‑speed swings that occur much more frequently, giving finer‑grained control. |
| **Explicit tolerances (PUMP_THR, DUMP_THR, H_TOL)** | Small dead‑zones avoid jittery torque flips when the velocities are near zero, reducing unnecessary actions that waste steps. |

