## 2️⃣  New strategy – “Energy‑shaping swing‑up + two‑joint PD balance”

### 2.1  Variables (same as before)

```text
c1 = obs[0]   # cos(θ1)
s1 = obs[1]   # sin(θ1)
c2 = obs[2]   # cos(θ2)
s3 = obs[3]   # sin(θ2)
w1 = obs[4]   # ω1
w2 = obs[5]   # ω2

θ1 = atan2(s1, c1)               # absolute angle of first link
θ2 = atan2(s3, c2)               # relative angle of second link
h  = -c1 - cos(θ1 + θ2)          # tip height above the pivot
sin_sum = sin(θ1 + θ2)           # sign tells which torque raises the tip
```

### 2.2  Parameter block (tuned empirically)

```text
# swing‑up
ENERGY_GAIN   = 1.2          # how aggressively we add energy
MAX_TORQUE    = 2            # 0:left, 1:none, 2:right

# balance (PD on both joints)
