## 2. New rule‑based policy (the one we will adopt)

Below is a compact pseudo‑code that incorporates the lessons above.  
All variables are taken directly from the observation vector `obs`:

```text
#--- unpack observation -------------------------------------------------
c1 = obs[0];  s1 = obs[1]          # cosθ1 , sinθ1
c2 = obs[2];  s2 = obs[3]          # cosθ2 , sinθ2
w1 = obs[4];  w2 = obs[5]          # ω1 , ω2  (only ω2 is used)

#--- geometric quantities ------------------------------------------------
θ1 = atan2(s1, c1)                # absolute angle of first link
