| Phase | What the rule does | Why it helps |
|-------|--------------------|--------------|
| **High‑speed coast** | `|ω₂| > 20 → action = 1` | When the swing is already very fast, any torque just adds noise; coasting lets the kinetic energy be conserved until the speed drops into a controllable range. |
