theta2 = math.atan2(s2, c2)                # relative angle of link 2
alpha   = theta1 + theta2                  # absolute angle of the tip
height  = -c1 - math.cos(alpha)            # tip height (‑cosθ1‑cos(θ1+θ2))
```

